{"4242100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Major Hoof", "steam_appid": 4242100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4812330], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Major Hoof – What This Game Really Is</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Major Hoof is a fast-paced, old-school 2D shooter that parodies classics like <i>Metal Slug</i>, combined with intense bullet-hell chaos and destructible environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight through long, action-heavy levels filled with enemies, constant pressure, and destructible environments. The core gameplay is simple: move fast, shoot constantly, and survive overwhelming situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a cynical commando trying to free victims of human trafficking. While presented in pixel art, the game touches on darker themes and includes a subtle, ironic take on the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visual style mixes Amiga-inspired pixel art with modern skeletal animation, creating a distinctive retro feel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can do in the game:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot, run, jump, and dodge under constant pressure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fight large groups of enemies in chaotic encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use melee combat alongside firearms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade weapons and abilities using earned points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore large levels designed around continuous action</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy games like Metal Slug or Broforce, this should feel familiar, but more chaotic and demanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo is available now. If you like what you see, consider adding the game to your wishlist — it helps a lot at this stage.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Major Hoof – 